"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிரம்","tr":"ciram"}]},{"text":"வாரா","tr":"vārā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரா","tr":"rā"}]},{"text":"தோரே","tr":"tōrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"வாருறு","parts":[{"text":"வார்","lemma":"வார்","gloss":"long/flowing"},{"text":"உறு","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having long flowing hair"},{"surface":"வணர்","parts":[{"text":"வணர்","lemma":"வணர்","gloss":"wavy/curled"}],"gloss":"wavy"},{"surface":"கதுப்பு","parts":[{"text":"கதுப்பு","lemma":"கதுப்பு","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"hair"},{"surface":"உளரி","parts":[{"text":"உளரி","lemma":"உளரு","gloss":"stroking"}],"gloss":"stroking"},{"surface":"புறம்","parts":[{"text":"புறம்","lemma":"புறம்","gloss":"back"}],"gloss":"back"},{"surface":"சேர்பு","parts":[{"text":"சேர்பு","lemma":"சேர்","gloss":"resting on"}],"gloss":"resting on"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அழாஅல்","parts":[{"text":"அழாஅல்","lemma":"அழாஅல்","gloss":"do not weep"}],"gloss":"do not weep"},{"surface":"என்று","parts":[{"text":"என்று","lemma":"என்","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"நம்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"நாம்","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"அழுத","parts":[{"text":"அழுத","lemma":"அழு","gloss":"wept"}],"gloss":"wept"},{"surface":"கண்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"eye"},{"surface":"துடைப்பார்","parts":[{"text":"துடை","lemma":"துடை","gloss":"wipe"},{"text":"ப்ப்","lemma":"ப்ப்","gloss":"tense marker"},{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"he (honorific)"}],"gloss":"he who wipes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யார்","parts":[{"text":"யார்","lemma":"யார்","gloss":"who"}],"gloss":"who"},{"surface":"ஆகுவர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"அர்","lemma":"அர்","gloss":"they/he"}],"gloss":"will he become"},{"surface":"கொல்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"சாரல்","parts":[{"text":"சாரல்","lemma":"சாரல்","gloss":"mountain slope"}],"gloss":"mountain slope"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெரும்புனக்","parts":[{"text":"பெரும்புனக்","lemma":"பெரும்புனக்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குறவன்","parts":[{"text":"குறவன்","lemma":"குறவன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறுதினை","parts":[{"text":"சிறுதினை","lemma":"சிறுதினை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மறுகாற்","parts":[{"text":"மறுகாற்","lemma":"மறுகாற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கொழுங்கொடி","parts":[{"text":"கொழுமை","lemma":"கொழுமை","gloss":"lush/fat"},{"text":"கொடி","lemma":"கொடி","gloss":"vine"}],"gloss":"lush vine"},{"surface":"அவரை","parts":[{"text":"அவரை","lemma":"அவரை","gloss":"lablab bean"}],"gloss":"lablab bean"},{"surface":"பூக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"பூ","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"flower"},{"text":"க்கும்","lemma":"க்கும்","gloss":"will/habitual suffix"}],"gloss":"will flower"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரும்பனி","parts":[{"text":"அருமை","lemma":"அருமை","gloss":"dense/rare"},{"text":"பனி","lemma":"பனி","gloss":"dew/cold"}],"gloss":"dense dew"},{"surface":"அச்சிரம்","parts":[{"text":"அச்சிரம்","lemma":"அச்சிரம்","gloss":"early winter"}],"gloss":"early winter"},{"surface":"வாராதோரே","parts":[{"text":"வாராதோர்","lemma":"வாராதோர்","gloss":"those who do not return"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"he who does not return indeed"}]}],"literal":"Stroking the long, wavy hair and letting it rest on the back, / saying 'do not weep' and wiping our wept eyes, / who will he become, my friend? On the mountain slope, / in the big field of the Kuravan, on the stubble of the small millet, / the lush vines of the lablab bean flower, / in this early winter of dense dew, he who does not return.","translation":"O friend, who will he be to me now—he who once stroked my long, wavy hair, letting it rest on my back, and wiped my tear-filled eyes, saying, 'Do not weep'? He has not returned even in this early winter season of dense dew, when the lush vines of the lablab bean flower on the stubble of the small millet in the hill-man's vast field.","modern":"தோழியே! நீண்ட, அலை அலையான கூந்தலைக் கோதி முதுகில் படரச் செய்து, 'அழாதே' என்று கூறி நம்முடைய அழுத கண்களைத் துடைத்தவர் இப்போது நமக்கு யார் ஆவார்? மலைச்சரிவில் உள்ள பெரிய புனத்தில், குறவனுடைய சிறுதினையின் அறுவடைக்குப் பின் எஞ்சிய தாள்களில், கொழுத்த கொடிகளையுடைய அவரை பூக்கின்ற அரிய பனி பொழியும் முன்பனிக் காலத்தில் அவர் இன்னும் திரும்பி வரவில்லையே!","explanation":"The heroine speaks to her confidante in distress as the promised season of the hero's return arrives without him. She recalls his past tenderness when he comforted her, stroking her hair and wiping her tears, and wonders what relationship they share now that he has delayed his return. The poem is set in the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape, where the onset of the early winter (acciram) is marked by the flowering of lablab beans on the stubble of harvested millet. This agricultural transition reflects the passage of time and the hero's broken promise, intensifying her loneliness. Key words like 'acciram' (early winter) and 'vārātōrē' (he who has not returned) highlight her longing.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}